  <static seed="91" source="Library/Union/setMVlinesplanes/lines-3.pg">
    <statement><p>Suppose a line is given by the system of equations
<BLOCKQUOTE>
<m>x = 5t-5</m>,<BR>
<m>y = 2t</m>,<BR>
<m>z = 2-4t</m>.
</BR></BR></BLOCKQUOTE></p>
<p>Then the vector and point that were used to define this line
were
<BLOCKQUOTE>
<m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;</m> = <fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0001"/>, and<BR>
<m>p</m> = <fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0002"/>.
</BR></BLOCKQUOTE></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;5,2,-4\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(-5,0,2\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
